      "text": "Ref. No.: FM/CS/2026/351 Date: August 05, 2026 National Stock Exchange of India Limited Exchange Plaza Plot No. C/1 G Block Bandra – Kurla Complex Bandra East Mumbai – 400 051. Scrip Symbol: SBIFUNDS BSE Limited Phiroze Jeejeebhoy Towers Dalal Street Mumbai – 400 001. Scrip Code: 544829 Dear Sir/Madam, Sub: Intimation for appointment of Senior Management Personnel Pursuant to Regulation 30 read with Schedule III of the Securities and Exchange Board of India (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015 (“SEBI Listing Regulations”) and basis recommendation of the Nomination and Remuneration Committee, we hereby inform you that the Board of Directors of the Company has approved today i.e. August 5, 2026, identification of Mr. Manish Mehta as Senior Management personnel of the Company , consequent to his appointment as Chief Business Officer effective from August 5, 2026. Disclosure of information as required under Regulation 30 of SEBI Listing Regulations read with SEBI Master Circular dated January 30, 2026 is enclosed as Annexure I. This intimation is also available on the Company’s website at https://sbifunds.com in compliance with Regulation 46 of the SEBI Listing Regulations. We request you to please take the above information on record. Thanking you, Yours faithfully, For SBI Funds Management Limited Vinaya Datar Chief Compliance Officer, Company Secretary and Head Legal Membership No.: ACS 15527 Encl: As above Annexure I Disclosure of information as required under Regulation 30 of SEBI Listing Regulations read with SEBI Master Circular dated January 30, 2026 S. No. Particulars Details 1. Reason for change viz. appointment, resignation, removal, death or otherwise Identification of Mr. Mehta, Chief Business Officer as Senior Management Personnel , consequent to his appointment as Chief Business Officer. 2. Date of appointment /reappointment/cessation (as applicable) & term of appointment/re-appointment August 05, 2026. Term : Not Applicable 3. Brief profile (in case of appointment) Mr. Manish Mehta has joined Company on August 05, 2026. He brings with him over three decades of experience in BFSI sector with domain knowledge across business development, planning, strategic partnerships, marketing, digital transformation, customer experience & customer acquisition. Prior to joining Company, he served as: • Co-Founder & Chief Executive Officer at Cap Alpha Investment Managers Private Limited (September 2025 - August 2026); • Joint President and Head of Sales, Marketing and Digital Business at Kotak Mahindra Asset Management Company Limited (November 2014 - August 2025); • President and CEO at Kotak Mahindra Inc. (September 2012 – November 2014) and Vice President (November 2010 – August 2012); • Head Sales at AIG Investments India (November 2006 – March 2010); and • Head Sales at Kotak Mahindra Asset Management Company Limited (July 1999 – October 2006). 4. Disclosure of relationships between directors (in case of appointment of a director). Not Applicable",
