rief details Notice under Section 94 of The Bharatia Nagarik Suraksha 2 | P a g e of dispute/litigation Sanhita, 2023 dated August 07 , 2026 by Police Station – Gariahat, West Bengal against our Company (“Notice”) w.r.t. investigation of case no. 185 dated 01/08/2026 alleging false representation and wrongful loss to the Complainant by promoters, company and three others. 2 Expected financial implications, if any, due to compensation, penalty, etc. Not applicable as this is notice for production of documents to the said police station 3 Quantum of claims, if any Not applicable as this is notice for production of documents to the said police station Kindly take the above information on record. Yours Faithfully, For SHANKAR LAL RAMPAL DYE-CHEM LTD Aditi Babel Company Secretary & Compliance Officer Membership No. F13506",
