      "text": "ARSS ARSS INFRASTRUCTURE PROJECTS LTD. Date: 08-08-2026 Bombay Stock Exchange Limited, National Stock Exchange of India Limited, Phiroze Jeejeebhoy Towers Exchange Plaza, Plot No-C1, G Block 1st Floor, Rotunda Building, BandraKurla Complex, Dalal Street, Bandra (E), Mumbai400 001 Mumbai-400051 BSE Scrip Code - 533163 NSE Symbol: ARSSINFRA Sub — Intimation regarding Work Order Dear Sir/Madam, In accordance with the Regulation 30 of the Securities and Exchange Board of India (Listing Obligation and Disclosure Requirements) Regulation 2015, we are pleased to inform you that we have received a work order of Rs. 19,78,77,668.00 (Rupees Nineteen Crore Seventy Eight Lakh Seventy Seven Thousand Six Hundred Sixty Eight rupees Only) for the work “Improvement such as widening and strengthening to DanagadiBangarkata road from 0/000 km to 27/040 km (except from 3/500 km to 4/500 km, from 7/000 km to 7/890 km, from 10/740 km to 12/007 km, from 16/960 km to 18/444 km and from 20/448 km to 20/627 km) in the district of Jajpur under State Plan.” from OFFICE OF THE SUPERINTENDING ENGINEER PANIKOILI (R&B) DIVISION, PANIKOLILI vide letter No. 6103 dated 05-08-2026 received by the company on 08-08-2026. Further, the details as required under Listing Regulations read with SEBI Circular no SEBI/HO/CFD/CFD-PoD-1/P/CIR/2023/123 dated 13t July, 2023 is enclosed as annexure A. This is for your information & record please. Thanking You Yours faithfully, For ARSS Infrastructure Projects Limited (Rajendra Biswal) Company Secretary & Compliance Officer ACS76448 Encl: As above Regd. Off.: Plot No-38, Sector —A, Zone-D, Mancheswar Industrial Estate, Bhubaneswar -751010 (Odisha) Tel-91 0674 2602763 Email :cs@arssgroup.in CIN : L141030R2000PLC006230 ARSS ARSS INFRASTRUCTURE PROJECTS LTD. ANNEXURE A Disclosures of information pursuant to Regulation 30 of the SEBI Listing Regulations read with SEBI Circular No. SEBI/HO/CFD/CFD-PoD-1/P/CIR/2023/123 dated 13t July, 2023: SL. PARTICULARS DE