      "text": "~atcom atcom technologies Itd August 10, 2026 To, To, The Listing Department The Listing Department National Stock Exchange of India Limited BSE Limited Exchange Plaza, 5thFIoor, Phiroze Jeejeebhoy Towers, Bandra-Kurla Complex, Dalal Street, Fort Bandra East, Mumbai400 051 Mumbai - 400 001 Symbol: ATCOM Scrip Code527007 Sub.: Outcome of the Board Meeting held on August 10, 2026 Ref.: Regulations 30 and 33 of the SEBI (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015 Dear Sir/Madam, Pursuant to Regulations 30 and 33 of the SEBI (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015, we hereby inform you that the Board of Directors of the Company, at its meeting held today, i.e., August 10, 2026, has approved the Unaudited Financial Results (Standalone and Consolidated) of the Company for the quarter ended June 30, 2026. inter alia, has considered and approved the following: 1. Appointment of Internal Auditor: Based on the recommendations of the Audit Committee, the Board has considered and approved the appointment of M/s. Hemraj Chheda & Co., Chartered Accountants, (Firm Registration No. 033187), Practicing Chartered Accountants as Internal Auditor of the Company for Financial Year 2026-27. Brief details of Internal Auditor of the Company are annexed herewith as ‘Annexure I'. 2. Appointment of Secretarial Auditor of the Company: Based on the recommendations of the Audit Committee, the Board has considered and approved the appointment of M/s. Sanil Dhayalkar & Co., Company Secretaries as Secretarial Auditor of the Company for Financial Year 2025-26. Brief details of Secretarial Auditor of the Company are annexed herewith as ‘Annexure I'. Disclosures as required under Securities and Exchange Board of India (Listing Obligation and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015 read with SEBI Circular ~ No. SEBI/HO/CFD/PoD2/CIR/P/0155 dated November 11, 2024 are enclosed herewith. The said financial results, along with the Limite