• Cash PAT for the Q1FY27 stood at ₹ 25 crs, a growth of 18% Y-o-Y basis Q 1 F Y 2 7 C o n s o l i d a t e d F i n a n c i a l H i g h l i g h t s 6 Revenue (in Rs. crs) 91.4 110.2 Q1FY26 Q1FY27 +21% Gross Margin (%) EBITDA Margin (%) PAT (in Rs. crs) EBITDA (in Rs. crs) Cash PAT# (in Rs. crs) # Cash PAT = Adjusted Profit after Tax + Depreciation Q1FY26 Q1FY27 67.9% 64.9% -350 bps 24.7 26.0 Q1FY26 Q1FY27 +5% 1.8 -1.4 Q1FY26 Q1FY27 -181% 21.7 25.6 Q1FY26 Q1FY27 +18% Q1FY26 Q1FY27 27.0% 23.6% -340 bps • Revenue for Q1FY27 stood at ₹ 110 crs, a growth of 21% Yo-Y with growth coming from across product categories and geography • Margins impacted because of increase in raw material prices due to supply chain disruptions and expenses relating to new Panchla and Amta facilities for which revenue will flow in coming years • PAT for the quarter stood at negative ₹ 1.4 crs. However, Cash PAT for the Q1FY27 stood at ₹ 25 crs, a growth of 18% Y-o-Y basis B r i d g e b e t w e e n S t a n d a l o n e & C o n s o l i d a t e d P A T – Q 1 F Y 2 7 7 (In Rs. Crs) 0.7 -1.4-1.1 -0.8 Standalone PAT SBLC Commission booked in Tarsons books, eliminated on consolidation Interest paid to bank by subsidiary Elimination of Amortisation on intangible assets acquired Nerbe PAT Consolidated PAT -1.0 0.8",
