      "text": "August 11, 2026 Listing Department Code: 532321 BSE LIMITED P J Towers, Dalal Street, Mumbai–400 001 Listing Department Code: ZYDUSLIFE NATIONAL STOCK EXCHANGE OF INDIA LIMITED Exchange Plaza, C/1, Block G, Bandra Kurla Complex, Bandra (E), Mumbai–400 051 Re: Disclosure under regulations 30 and 46(2)(oa) of SEBI (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015 (“the Listing Regulations”) Pursuant to the provisions of regulations 30 and 46(2)(oa) of the Listing Regulations, we hereby inform that the audio recording of the Company’s Investor Call discussing about the unaudited financial results for the quarter ended on June 30, 2026, is available on the Company’s website. The link to access the said audio recording is as under: https://zyduslife.com/public/pdf/Audio-Recording-of-Investor-Call-11-Aug-2026.mp3 Thanking you, Yours faithfully, For, Zydus Lifesciences Limited Dhaval N. Soni Company Secretary and Compliance Officer Membership No. FCS7063",
