ure results. Actual results may differ materially from those anticipated in the forward -looking statements. The company assumes no obligation to update forward -looking statements to reflect actual results changed assumptions or other factors. For further details please contact: Company Investor Relations Advisors Galaxy Surfactants Ltd. CIN No: L39877MH1986PLC039877 Name: Mr. Ruchir Soni Email id: Ruchir.Soni@galaxysurfactants.com Strategic Growth Advisors Pvt. Ltd. CIN No: U74140MH2010PTC204285 Mr. Mandar Chavan / Mr. Rahul Agarwal Email id: mandar.chavan@sgapl.net / rahul.agarwal@sgapl.net Tel No: +91 96993 82195 / +91 98214 38864",
