      "text": "KRN HEAT EXCHANGER AND REFRIGERATION LIMITED Registered & Work Office: Plot No.: F-46,47,48,49, EPIP, RIICO Industrial Area, Neemrana – 301705 (RJ) CIN No.: L29309RJ2017PLC058905 Contact No. 9116629184 (+91)-9116629184 info@krnheatexchanger.com www.krnheatexchanger.com Date: 13th August, 2026 To, BSE Ltd Phiroze Jeejeebhoy Towers, Dalal Street, Mumbai400001, Maharashtra, India Script Code: 544263 To, National Stock Exchange of India Limited Exchange Plaza, C-I Block G, Bandra Kurla Complex, Bandra (East), Mumbai-400051, Maharashtra, India Script Symbol: KRN ISIN: INE0Q3J01015 Subject: Investors’ Presentation Dear Sir/Madam, Pursuant to the requirement of Regulation 30 read with Part A of Schedule III of the SEBI (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015, please find enclosed herewith the copy of the Investor Presentation in relation to the unaudited Standalone and consolidated Financial Results of the Company for the quarter ended on June 30, 2026. The same is also being uploaded on the Company’s website at www.krnheatexchanger.com. Kindly take the above information on your record. Thanking You, For KRN Heat Exchanger and Refrigeration Limited Jitendra Kumar Sharma Company Secretary Investor Presentation | Q1 FY27 1 KRN Heat Exchanger and Refrigeration Limited Investor Presentation Q1 FY27 Fin & Tube Bar & Plate Refrigerator Components Complete HVAC System Railway Bus AC Investor Presentation | Q1 FY27 2 DisclaimerSafe Harbour Statement This presentation and the accompanying slides (the “Presentation”), which have been prepared by KRN Heat Exchanger And Refrigeration Limited (“KRN” or “the Company”) solely for information purposes, do not constitute any offer, recommendation, or invitation to purchase or subscribe for any securities, and shall not form the basis of or be relied on in connection with any contract or binding commitment whatsoever. No offering of securities of the Company will be made except by means of a statutory offering document containing detailed information about the Company. This Presentation has been prepared by the Company based on information and data which the Company considers reliable, but the Company makes no representation or warranty, express or implied, whatsoever, and no reliance shall be placed on the truth, accuracy, completeness, fairness, or reasonableness of the contents of this Presentation. This Presentation may not be all-inclusive and may not contain all of the information that you may consider material. Any liability in respect of the contents of, or any omission from, this Presentation is expressly excluded. Certain matters discussed in this Presentation may contain statements regarding the Company’s market opportunity and business prospects that are individually and collectively forward-looking statements. Such forward-looking statements are not a guarantee of future performance and are subject to known and unknown risks, uncertainties, and assumptions that are difficult to predict. These risks and uncertainties include, but are not limited to, the performance of the Indian economy and of the economies of various international markets, the performance of the industry in India and worldwide, competition, the Company’s ability to successfully implement its strategy, the Company’s future levels of growth and expansion, technological implementation, changes and advancements, changes in revenue, income, or cash flows, the Company’s market preferences and its exposure to market risks, as well as other risks. The Company’s actual results, levels of activity, performance, or achievements could differ materially and adversely from the results expressed in or implied by this Presentation. The Company assumes no obligation to update any forward-looking information contained in this Presentation. Any forward-looking statements and projections made by third parties included in this Presentation are not adopted by the Company, and the Company is not responsible for such third-party statements and projections. Investor Presentation | Q1 FY27 3 DiimeIndex Particulars • About the Company • Vision, Mission and Values • Business Segments • Journey • About Founder and CMD • Board of Directors and KMP • State of the Art Facility • Global Presence • Revenue Mix and Export Market • Product & Applications of Products • Certifications • Awards • Workforce Strength & Capability Particulars • Q1 FY27 Performance and Outlook by the Chairman & Managing Director • Q1 FY27 Key Financial HighlightStandalone • Q1 FY27 Key Financial Highlight-Consolidated • Q1 FY27 Profit & Loss Statement • Q1 FY26 Revenue Highlights • Financial Performance: Multi-year Overview • Multi-year Consolidated Profit & Loss Statement & Cash Flow Statement • Multi-Year Consolidated Balance Sheet • Shareholding Pattern & Share Price Performance • Contacts Investor Presentation | Q1 FY27 4 DisclaimerAbout The Company Founded in October 2017 and headquartered in Neemrana, Rajasthan, KRN Heat Exchanger and Refrigeration Limited is one of India's leading manufacturers of heat exchangers and HVAC&R solutions for residential, commercial, and industrial applications. The Company manufactures heat exchangers, cooling coils, and integrated HVAC&R solutions for domestic and global markets, with a diversified portfolio comprising Fin & Tube Coils, Bar & Plate, Complete HVAC Systems, Bus AC Systems, Refrigeration Components, Technical Tubes, Sheet Metal Parts, and Tubings. KRN serves diverse end-use industries including HVAC, refrigeration, data centers, automotive, railways, industrial cooling, process applications, power, and marine. Its state-of-the-art manufacturing facilities in Neemrana, Rajasthan are equipped with integrated production, testing, and quality-control infrastructure, enabling efficient manufacturing and ensuring high standards of quality and precision. Focused on customized product development, precision engineering, operational excellence, and stringent quality standards, KRN delivers reliable, application-specific solutions. Supported by a skilled workforce and a customer-centric approach, the Company continues to strengthen its domestic and international presence, with established exports across key geographies including North America, Europe, and the UAE. The Company got listed in NSE and BSE in October, 2024 Investor Presentation | Q1 FY27 5 Disclaimer Our mission is to design and manufacture high-performance, energyefficient, and customized thermal solutions that meet global standards and consistently exceed customer expectations. Our vision is to become a globally recognized leader in thermal engineering solutions by consistently delivering innovation, quality, and sustainability. Our values define who we are and guide every decision we make. They are the foundation of our commitment to excellence and customer satisfaction. OUR VISION OUR MISSION OUR VALUES Investor Presentation | Q1 FY27 6 KRN Heat Exchanger And Refrigeration Limited Business Segments KRN HVAC Products Private Limited Punjab Hyderabad Indore Delhi Ahmedabad Noida Service Centres Fin & Tube Bar & Plate Refrigerator Components Complete HVAC System Railway Bus AC Investor Presentation | Q1 FY27 7 Journey 2020 Manufacturing Expansion Expanded the manufacturing facility to 7,800 sq. mt. through the acquisition of Plots No. 46 and 47. Facility Expansion 2019 Export Journey Began Entered international markets with the commencement of product exports. Global Expansion Incorporation Manufacturing Unit 2018 Manufacturing Commenced Commercial manufacturing operations commenced with the installation of production machinery. 2017 Established KRN established its manufacturing facility in Neemrana, Rajasthan in October 2017.",
