      "text": "Date: 14.08.2026 To, The General Manager, Listing Operations Department of Corporate Services BSE Limited P. J. Towers, Dalal Street, Fort, Mumbai400 001 Stock Code: 532891 The Manager, Listing Department, National Stock Exchange of India Limited, Exchange Plaza, 5th Floor, Plot No. C/1, G Block, Bandra-Kurla Complex, Bandra (E), Mumbai400 051 Stock Code: PURVA Dear Sir / Madam, Sub: Analysts/Institutional Investors Meeting – Presentation Ref: Regulation 30 read with Schedule III of Securities and Exchange Board of India ( Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015 We write to inform you that we are enclosing herewith the presentation on the Un-audited Standalone and Consolidated Financial Results for the quarter ended June 30, 2026, to be made to the Analysts/Institutional Investors and the same is also being made available on the Company’s website www.puravankara.com. This is for your information and records. Thanking you, Yours sincerely, For Puravankara Limited (Sudip Chatterjee) Company Secretary & Compliance Officer ICSI Membership No.: F11373 1 Artist’s impression of Purva Silversky, Bengaluru Investor Corporate Presentation Q1 FY 2027 Artist’s impression of Purva Estrella, Mumbai Table of 2 Contents T A B L E O F C O N T E N T S B U I L D I N G S P A C E S . E N R I C H I N G L I V E S . 01 Company Overview 03-05 02 Revenue & PAT 06-07 03 Sales & Collection 08-11 04 Pan-India Presence 12-16 05 Update on Financials 17-18 06 Update on Cashflows 19-22 07 Efficient Capital Management 23-25 08 Project Status 26-33 09 Good Governance practices 34-36 10 Other Corporate Information 37-47 11 Disclaimer 48 01 B U I L D I N G T R U S T F O R F I V E D E C A D E S Company Overview Puravankara Limited · Investor Presentation Q1 FY27 For over five decades, Puravankara has shaped India’s urban landscape through thoughtfully designed residential and commercial developments, built on a foundation of trust, quality and execution excellen