y accepted in India, and policies has not disclosed the information required to be disclosed in terms of Regulation 33 of the SEBI (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015 including the manner in which it is to be disclosed, or that it contains any material misstatement. Our conclusion is not modified in respect of this matter. For KASG & Co. Chartered Accountants FRN: 002228C MM(M,(MZ i C Roshan Kumar Bajaj Place: Kolkata (Partner) Date: 14 August, 2026 Membership No. 068523 'UDIN26068523MHOFTX7232 OUR PRESENCE : NORTH : NEW DELHI | GURUGRAM (HARYANA) | RUDRAPUR (UTTARAKHAND) | VARANASI (UTTAR PRADESH) EAST : KOLKATA, RANIGANJ (WEST BENGAL) | BOKARO, DHANBAD, RANCHI (JHARKHAND) WEST : MUMBAI (MAHARASHTRA) SOUTH : BENGALURU (KARNATAKA) T+91334815 5413 www.kasggroup.com Regd. Office: HB - 170, Sector-lII, Salt Lake, Kolkata - 700 106 CIN-L51216WB1992PL C055629 KAUSHALYA INFRASTRUCTURE DEVELOPMENT CORPORATION LIMITED UNAUDITED STANDALONE FINANCIAL RESULTS FOR THE QUARTER ENDED 30 JUNE, 2026 QUARTER ENDED YEAR ENDED 30thJune2025 | 31stMarch2026 | 30th June2025 [ 3istMarch, 2026 Particulars (Unaudited) (Audited) (Unaudited) (Audited) (1) Revenue from operations 125 6.63 216 8989 ol e — 034 083 10264 10530 159 7.46 10480 195.19 (2) Costof materials co 040 068 039 2 (b) Employe benefits expense 826 2342 656 wa () Finance costs 1741 12 1741 69.93 (d) Depreciation expense 054 064 064 256 (¢) Other expenses 1427 947 425 7163 Total Expenses (4) ) 4088 5143 924 190.78 (5) Profiv (loss) before tax and exceptional ftems(3) - (4) (3929)] (3.96) 3555 Tl Exceptional liems T - - - - Profit before t B 929) (43.96) 3555 a0 (6) Tax Expense. (a) Current tax (i) Current tax for current year - : - (i) Current tax for the carlir years - - 029 (b) Deferred tax 961 (10:88) 9.2 182 “Total tax expense (6) 961 (10.88) 9.12 211 (7) Profit/ (loss) for the year (5) - (6) ) (48.90) (33.08) 2643 230 (8) Other comprehensive income (a) ltems that will be reclassified to stat