      "text": "SKF India Limited Registered office: Chinchwad, Pune 411 033, Maharashtra, India Tel: +91 (20) 6611 2500, Fax no: +91 (20) 6611 2396, Web: www.skf.com, Email id: investorIndia@skf.com CIN: L29130PN1961PLC213113 Date: 14th August 2026 National Stock Exchange of India Limited, Exchange Plaza, 5 th Floor, Plot No. C-1, G Block, BandraKurla Complex, Bandra (East), Mumbai – 400051, Maharashtra, India BSE Limited, Phiroze Jeejeebhoy Towers, Dalal Street, Fort Mumbai – 400001, Maharashtra, India NSE Scrip Code – SKFINDIA BSE Scrip Code - 500472 Subject: Business Presentation at 65 th Annual General Meeting held on 14th August 2026. Dear Sir/Madam, We are enclosing herewith the Business Presentation made by Mr. Shailesh Kumar Sharma, Managing Director of the Company, during the 65th Annual General Meeting held on 14th August 2026, marked as Annexure - A. We request you to kindly take the above information on record and disseminate the same on your respective websites. Yours faithfully, For SKF India Limited _____________________ Mayuri Kulkarni Company Secretary & Compliance Officer 0 F r i d a y , 1 4 th A u g u s t 2 0 2 6 Shailesh Sharma Managing Director 65th Annual General Meeting SKF India Limited 1 Across the Slides 1 1 2 3 The Demerger Story Our Business Performance Review Growing Sustainably4 2 The Demerger Story SECTION 1 The Demerger Story Effective 1st October, 2025, SKF India Limited entered a new phase of value creation by demerging its ‘Industrial’ business. This shift established two independent, purpose-built entities: SKF India Limited and SKF India (Industrial) Limited Why the Demerger? Different Market Dynamics Distinct Customer Needs Focused Capital Allocation Faster Decision Making Independent Growth Strategies SKF India (Industrial) Limited Focused on infrastructure and manufacturing, serving industries through lifecycle-led demand and long-term asset performance. Industrial Focused on advancing future mobility through electrification, premiumisation and next-generation automotive technologies. SKF India Limited Automotive 3 SKF India Limited is the automotive arm delivering advanced mobility solutions. With over a century in India, we have evolved into a trusted partner supporting the future of mobility. 3 Offices 1923 The Year We Began Our Operations in India 330 Partners across the Distribution Network 3 Manufacturing Facilities 933 Employees We are SKF India Limited at a glance SECTION 1 The Demerger Story 3 4 SKF announced the future brand name of the Automotive business SECTION 1 The Demerger Story SKF Vertevo: A new name that reflects our evolution while carrying forward the trust, expertise and engineering excellence that define us. SKF Vertevo combines two powerful ideas: vertere, Latin for “to turn” or “to transform”, and evo, short for “evolution”. Together, they express movement, progress, and change. It’s short, bold, and memorable a name that works across cultures and captures our story. SKF Vertevo is not just a brand. We are your partner for the journey ahead. 5 Our Purpose, Values and Culture SECTION 1 The Demerger Story Purpose We Move People Further Values Collaboration Curiosity Courage Care Working together across teams and with customers to create shared success. Continuously learning, innovating, and embracing new possibilities. Taking ownership, challenging convention, and driving improvement. Acting responsibly for our people, customers, and society. Culture Take ownership and deliver with accountability Collaborate across boundaries to solve challenges faster Learn and adapt as technologies and markets evolve Stay close to customers, ensuring relevance in every solution Act responsibly, integrating safety and sustainability into our work We 6 Engineering Solutions Across Every Mobility Segment SECTION 2 OUR BUSINESS Our Solutions Powertrain solutions Drive Control Solutions Wheel-End Solutions Electric Mobility Solutions Aftermarket Solutions Passenger Vehicles Commercial Vehicles Two and Three-Wheelers Aftermarket Our Vehicle Categories",
