y 1.2% and 4.8%, respectively. On a consolidated basis Q1FY27 revenue grew by 20.8% and gross profit grew by 6.6% over Q4FY26. ➢ Continue to drive business with an unchanged focus on cost management and yield measures which has enabled the organization to deliver stable performance in a volatile environment ➢ Strategic focus on maintaining trade lane profitability and continuous monitoring of container utilization. ➢ Higher cost borrowings (long term + short term) at standalone level have further reduced to Rs. 272 crores as on 30th June 2026 as against Rs. 314 crores as on 31st March 2026. Global Presence in International Supply Chain Business EUROPE AMERICAS APAC ISC & MEA Worlds # 1 LCL Consolidator (14% market share)# Global Neutral FCL Air Freight D2D services Value Added Services 30+ Years of Expertise 2400+ Direct Trade Lanes 4500+ Employees 643k* FCL Volume (TEU) 8.5M* LCL Volume (Cbm) 33k* Air Volume (Tons) *Export and import handling combined (FY26). #As per internal estimates. 200+ own offices across 60+ countries Core Business Strengths Digital First Approach Leading Single Brand Global Network End to End Logistics Local Expertise, Globally New Markets & Products Expansion in select hinterland geographies Expansion in Africa Xcelerate (Air+ Sea product) Renewables & New energy business Strategic Focus Areas Focus on growth of long-haul trade lanes Launch of new trade lanes in the key identified markets Technology led inside sales to capture longtail customers in China, LATAM, & other markets Sales Acceleration initiatives deeply integrated with CRM Growth opportunities with regional & local accounts Expansion of retail business into international markets Growth Drivers Strategic presence through alliance & partners in smaller countries Increase presence and market share in LATAM Expanding FCL footprint Growth & expansion of new LCL products Expanding Air product through new markets & strategic partnerships Scale door-todoor offering Cross border E-commerce Procurement Long standing carrier relations with assured capacity access Improve yield by optimized procurement AI & Automation AI and RPA automation for improved overall experience Strong pipeline of AI projects across Sales, Operations, and Finance Processes & Systems Process optimization is elevating quality, productivity, utilization, and standards while reducing complexity iTopaz, is being rearchitected to a cloud native & AI enabled platform Cost Initiatives Consolidating front and backoffice functions into SSC for scale and efficiency Introduction of AI to eliminate identified operational processes to optimize staff cost Staff Restructuring",
