      "text": "_____________________________________________________________________________________ _____________________________________________________________________________________ Date: August 15, 2026 To, The General Manager National Stock Exchange of India Ltd., Exchange Plaza, 5th Floor, Plot No. C/1, G -Block, Bandra -Kurla Complex Bandra (E), Mumbai - 400051 The General Manager Bombay Stock Exchange Limited, P. J. Towers, Dalal Street, Fort, Mumbai-400001 NSE Symbol: HARDWYN Scrip Code: 541276 Subject: Newspaper Publication of Standalone and Consolidated Un-audited financial results for the quarter ended June 30, 2026. Dear Sir/Madam, Pursuant to Regulation 47 of the SEBI (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015, as amended, we hereby enclose copies of newspaper advertisements pertaining to the Un-audited Standalone and Consolidated Financial Results of the Company for the Quarter ended June 30, 2026. These Un-audited financial results were duly approved by the Board of Directors at their Meeting held on Friday, August 14, 2026. The said Results are published on 15th August 2026, in the following newspapers: i. Financial Express – English edition dated 15th August 2026. ii. Jansatta – Hindi edition dated 15th August 2026. Kindly acknowledge the receipt of the aforesaid document and take it on record. Thanking you, Yours faithfully For Hardwyn India Limited Rubaljeet Singh Sayal Managing Director & CFO DIN: 00280624 Encl: As above ����������� ������� ������������������������ ��������� ������ ��� ���� �������� �� ������� ���� ����������� �������� �� ��� ����������� ��� �� ��� �������� � ����� �������������� ������� � ���������� ��� � � � � � � ���� � � �� � � � � � � ������� � �� � � �� � �� �� �� � � � � ����� ���������� � � �� � � �� � �� �� �� � � � � ���� � �� �� � � � �� �� � � � � � � � � � � � � � � � �� � � � � ������ � � �� ���������������� ����� ��� ���� ������ �� �� ���� �������������� ����� ����� ����������� ���������