      "text": "Winsome Yarns Limited Regd. Office : Basement, SCO 13-14-15 Sector 34-A, Chandigarh – 160022 INDIA CIN : L17115CH1990PLC010566 Phones : 9780078797 E-mail : winsomeyarnslimited@gmail.com Website : winsomeyarns.com Date:- 17.08.2026 Scrip Code: 514348 Symbol : WINSOME Corporate Compliance & Listing Centre Listing Department BSE Limited National Stock Exchange of India Ltd 1st Floor, New Trading Ring \"Exchange Plaza\" Rotunda Building, P. J. Towers Bandra-Kurla Complex Bandra (E), Dalal Street, Fort, MUMBAI-400001 MUMBAI – 400051 Subject: Reply to Exchange observation regarding reason for delay in Financial Statements Dear Sir/Madam, With reference to the Exchange's communication dated August 12, 2026 regarding reason for delay in Financial Statements of the Company for the quarter ended June 30, 2026, in terms of Regulation 33 of the SEBI (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015 (\"SEBI LODR Regulations\"), we wishes to submit the following: Resolution Plan in respect of the Company, submitted under Section 31 of the Insolvency and Bankruptcy Code, 2016, was approved by the Hon'ble National Company Law Tribunal, Chandigarh vide its order dated April 16, 2026 (\"Approval Order\"). As the Approval Order falls within the quarter ended June 30, 2026, the Company is entitled, in terms of the proviso to Regulation 33(3) of the SEBI (LODR) Regulations, 2015, to file its financial results for the said quarter within 90 days from the end of the quarter in which the Resolution Plan was approved, i.e., on or before September 28, 2026, as against the standard timeline of 45 days from the end of the quarter that would otherwise apply. We request the Exchange to take the above on record and to note that the financial results for the quarter ended June 30, 2026 shall be filed accordingly, in terms of the aforesaid proviso to Regulation 33(3) of the SEBI (LODR) Regulations, 2015. We request the Exchange to kindly take the above submission on