      "text": "BSE Limited Phiroze Jeejeebhoy Towers, Dalal Street, Mumbai - 400001 Scrip Code: 542323 National Stock Exchange of India Limited Exchange Plaza, Bandra Kurla Complex, Bandra (E), Mumbai - 400051 Symbol: KPIGREEN Sub.: Energization of Further Capacity under the 370 MW AC / 677 MW DC Wind-Solar Hybrid Power Project Dear Sir/Madam, We wish to inform you that KPI Green Energy Limited (\"the Company\") has energized further capacity under its 370 MW AC / 677 MW DC Wind -Solar Hybrid Power Project (IPP) at Bharuch, Gujarat, comprising 130 MW AC / 195 MW DC Solar capacity. With the energizing of the aforesaid capacity, the Company has cumulatively energized 269.7 MW AC / 389.7 MW DC capacity under the said Wind-Solar Hybrid IPP Project. This project is being developed by the Company as an Independent Power Producer (IPP) under a long-term Power Purchase Agreement with Gujarat Urja Vikas Nigam Limited (GUVNL). The Company continues to steadily expand its Independent Power Producer (IPP) portfolio, as it simultaneously scales its EPC business. The progressive energisation of capacity under long-term PPAs further strengthens the Company's annuity -based, recurring revenue streams, enhancing earnings visibility and creating sustained long-term value for its stakeholders. This is for your information and records. Thanking You, For KPI Green Energy Limited Moh. Sohil Yusuf Dabhoya Whole Time Director DIN: 07112947 KPI/MAT/AUG/2026/808 Date: August 17, 2026",
