 is the Company Secretary and Compliance Officer of our Company, and was appointed as the Company Secretary with effect from January 18, 2025 and Compliance Officer with effect from June 10, 2025. He is responsible for secretarial, compliance and legal functions. He joined our Company as General Manag er – Company Secretary and Legal on October 16, 2024. He holds a Bachelor’s Degree in Commerce from Bharathiar University, Coimbatore, Tamil Nadu and a Bachelor’s Degree of LL.B from Sri Venkateswara University, Tirupati, Andhra Pradesh. He is an associate member of the Institute of Company Secretaries of India. He was previously associated with TVS Group, Amara Raja Group, Ashok Leyland Limited and ELGI Equipments Limited. He has over 1 7 years of experience in legal, secretarial and compliance functions. 4. Disclosure of relationship between directors (in case of appointment of a Director) Not Applicable",
