 project finance, taxation, corporate compliance, governance and strategic finance. Hari has served as Chief Financial Officer of Matrimony.com Limited and Indiavidual Learning Limited - Embibe, the edtech business within the Reliance Jio group. At Matrimony.com Limited, he led several cost saving initiatives and a high impact revenue enhancement project as well. At Embibe, he helped scale the organisation and stre ngthen its finance and support infrastructure. Across his earlier roles, he led several complex initiatives, including US GAAP conversion, SOX compliance and significant debt refinancing activities. His experience includes multientity consolidation involving more than 100 subsidiaries, listedcompany compliance and governance, financial controls, treasury management, business partnering and finance and business transformation. Earlier in his career, he held senior finance roles at Vedanta, Den Networks and Jio Platforms, building extensive experienc e across complex, high -growth and multinational business environments. Hari is a Chartered Accountant from the Institute of Chartered Accountants of India, having qualified in 2004. He holds a B. Com from Madurai Kamaraj University and completed all three levels of the US CFA Program in 2013. *****",
