g that there is no objection from anybody and the application will be finally decided. PUBLIC NOTICE IN THE HON'BLE COURT OF CIVIL JUDGE (SENIOR DIVISION) THANE, AT THANE MISC. APPLICATION NO. 730 OF 2026 By Order. Sd/- Asst. Superintendent, Civil Court S.D, Thane. 1. Smt. Mandakini Vijaykant Raithatha, Age : 81 Years, Occupation : Housewife, Residing at: Building No. 22, Room No. 706, Shree Sandesh CHS, Pokhran Road No. 1, Vartak Nagar, Thane (West), Maharashtra - 400606. 2. Mr. Arun Vijaykant Raithatha, Age : 54 Years, Occupation : Service, Residing at: Building No. 22, Room No. 706, Shree Sandesh CHS, Pokhran Road No. 1, Vartak Nagar, Thane (West), Maharashtra - 400606. 3. Mrs. Hemakshi Jayesh Thakkar, Age : 55 Years, Occupation : Service, Residing at: Flat No. A/2, 203, Venus Upvan CHS Ltd., Pokhran Road No. 2, Gawand Baug, Near Upvan Lake, Thane - 400610. ...Applicants Vs NIL …Opponents Jr. Clerk Given under the hand and seal of the Court this 18th day of August, 2026. 18-08-2026 Tuesday 3÷kufr{ºk, LOKMITRA Printed and Publ ished b y MAYUR C. BHA TT on behal f of KAL YANI PUBLIATION PVT. LTD. and Printed at : Dharti Printers C -3, Shankar Chember, Nr. Fadia Chamber, Asharam Road, Ahmedabad-Publ ished From KALYANI PUBLIA TION PVT . LTD. 201,202,208 Nandan complex, opp mithakhali rly crossing, mithakhali, ahmedabad. Editior : Mayur C. Bhatt MfkÞðuÍ yuh ‚Šð‚e‚ r÷r{xuz™e «khtr¼f ònuh ykuVh 24 yku„Mx, 2026™k hkus ¾q÷þu y{ËkðkË, MfkÞðuÍ yuh ‚Šð‚e‚ r÷r{xuzu Œu™e «khtr¼f ònuh ykuVh {kxu Y. 10 ™e {q¤ ®f{Œ™k RÂõðxe þìh {kxu þìh ËeX Y. 131 Úke Y. 138 Yr…Þk™e «kR‚ ƒuLz ™¬e fhe Au. ft…™e™e «khtr¼f ònuh ykuVh ( \"IPO\" yÚkðk \"ykuVh\") 24 yku„Mx, 2026 ™k hkus ¾q÷þu, su ‚ƒÂM¢Ãþ™ {kxu W…÷çÄ Úkþu y™u 27 yku„Mx, 2026 ™k hkus ƒtÄ Úkþu. hkufkýfkhku ykuAk{kt ykuAk 100 RÂõðxe þìh {kxu y™u íÞkhƒkË 100 RÂõðxe þuh™k „wýktf{kt ƒku÷e ÷„kðe þfu Au. yks™e Œkhe¾ ‚wÄe Y. 10 ™k {qÕÞ™k 11,64,45,244 RÂõðxe þìh ƒkfe Au su Au. yk IPO 2,88,98,300 RÂõðxe þìh™ku ™ðku R~Þq Au y™u «{kux‚o Þþ…k÷ þ{ko (