dustries.com, Phone: +91-294-2429513; Fax: +91-294-2429515 Website: http://www.bohraindustries.com ___________________________________________________________________________________________ Annexure A Sr. No. Particulars Mahesh Kumar Hada (DIN: 10778619) 1. Reason for change Resignation of Mr Mahesh Kumar Hada (DIN: 10778619) as a Non-Executive Independent Director of the Company due to personal reasons and other professional commitments with effect from 19th August 2026 2. Date and terms of cessation Date of cessation: 19th August 2026 3. Term of appointment Not Applicable 4. Brief profile (in case of appointment); Not Applicable 5. Disclosure of relationships between directors (in case of appointment of a director) Not Applicable 6. Affirmation that the Director being appointed is not debarred from holding the office of director by virtue of any SEBI order or any other such authority Not Applicable. 7. The independent director shall, along with the detailed reasons, also provide a confirmation that there is no other material reasons other than those provided. Mr Mahesh Kumar Hada (DIN: 10778619) has confirmed that there are no material reasons for his resignation other than those mentioned in his resignation letter. Bohra Udaipur Resignation Letter BIL 1 message M.K. Hada Wed, Aug 19, 2026 at 2:49 PM To: bil@bohraindustries.com Cc: Atul Dave , Anshu Agarwal Dear Sir, Please find attached my resignation letter dated August 19, 2026. It has been a great privilege working on the board of BIL as an Independent Director. Sincerely, Maj Gen (Dr) Mahesh Kumar Hada (Retd) 9650840123 Resignation letter_BIL_19.08.2026.pdf 43K Bohra Industries Limited Mail - Resignation Letter BIL https://mail.google.com/mail/u/0/?ik=18a45fd8f6&view=pt&search=al... 1 of 1 19-08-2026, 02:54 pm",
