      "text": "Date: 19.08.2026 To The ManagerListing Compliance National Stock Exchange India Limited Exchange Plaza, Plot No. C/1, G Block, Bandra Kurla complex, Bandra (E), Mumbai 400051 NSE Symbol: NRL; ISIN: INE0JM501013 Sub: Intimation of Earnings Conference Call for Financial Performance of the Company for quarter ended June 30, 2026 pursuant to Regulation 30 of SEBI (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements), Regulations, 2015 Dear Sir / Madam, In compliance with Regulation 30 read with Schedule III, Para A (15) of the Listing Regulations and SEBI Master Circular dated November 11, 2024, (updated as on January 30, 2026), and other applicable provisions of the Listing Regulations, we hereby inform you that the Earnings Conference Call (“Earnings Call”) of the Company for the quarter ended June 30, 2026, has been scheduled as under: Date Inclusion/ exclusions of Audience/partici pants, if any Particulars of Event Venue / Location Mode of attending Details pertaining to registrations Disclaimers / note to complete / ease registration / attending the call August 24, 2026 Analysts/ Institutional and other Investors/ Others Earnings Conference Call (“Earnings Call”) of the Company for the quarter ended June 30, 2026 (post the announcement of financial results for the quarter ended June 30, 2026 to the Stock Exchanges) Hosted from Mumbai Via Dial in/ Audio Conference Call Refer Annexure that contains the link and dial in details to join the Call. Joinees can pre - register for the Earnings Call through the “Pre -registration link” provided in the Call Invite enclosed herewith. Upon clicking the link, participants may complete the registration by providing the requisite details and join the Earnings Call using the dial -in details provided in the Call Invite. Mr. Rajesh Gupta, Managing Director of the Company will participate in the Earnings Call. The discussion during the Earnings Call will be based on publicly available information. No unpublished price sensitive information (“UPSI”) is intended to be disclosed during the Earnings Call. The schedule of the Earnings Call is subject to change due to exigencies on the part of the investor(s) or the Company. In the event of any such change, the same shall be duly intimated to the Stock Exchanges. The aforesaid information is also available on the website of the Company at www.nupurrecyclers.com. The invite for the Earnings Call is enclosed herewith for reference. You are requested to take the above information on record and disseminate the same to all concerned. FOR NUPUR RECYCLERS LIMITED SHILPA VERMA Company Secretary & Compliance Officer M. No: F10105 NUPUR RECYCLERS LIMITED is pleased to invite you for a EARNINGS CALL to discuss Q1 FY27 results on Monday, 24th Aug, 2026 16:00 (IST) Mr. Rajesh Gupta Managing Director Management Participant Dial in Details Universal Dial In: +91 22 6280 1102 / +91 22 7115 8003 International Numbers USA: 186674 62133 UK: 080810 11573 Hong Kong: 80096 4448 Singapore: 80010 12045 Preregistration link Click Here For more information, please contact: Anand Venugopal / Pratham Chaturvedi Mobile: +91 70218 52071 / +91 96190 76771 Email: anand.venugopal@adfactorspr.com/ pratham.chaturvedi@adfactorspr.com www.nupurrecyclers.com",
