10 35 17,84,710 Category III (High Net-worth Individual Investors Portion) 1,066 6,18,787 68 54,269 998 5,64,518 998 5,64,518 Category IV (Retail Individual Investors Portion) 4,500 3,05,843 149 6,594 4,351 2,99,249 4,351 2,99,249 TOTAL 5,650 31,12,911 256 1,63,664 5,394 29,49,247 5,394 29,49,247 The details of the abovementioned issuance pursuant to the SEBI Listing Regulations and the SEBI circular bearing reference number SEBI/HO/49/14/14(7)2025-CFD-POD2/I/3762/2026 dated January 30, 2026, are enclosed in Annexure A. . We request you to take the above on record. All capitalized terms used but not specifically defined here shall have the meaning ascribed to such terms in the Prospectus. Thanking you, Yours faithfully, For Paisalo Digital Limited (MANENDRA SINGH) Company Secretary ANNEXURE A 1. Size of the issue Public issue of secured, rated, listed, redeemable non-convertible debentures of face value of ₹1000 each amounting up to ₹ 15,000 Lakh with an option to retain over -subscription up to ₹ 15,000 Lakh aggregating up to ₹ 30,000 Lakh, which is within the shelf limit of ₹ 90,000 Lakh. Allotment of 29,49,247 secured, rated, listed, redeemable non -convertible debentures of face value of ₹ 1000 each aggregating up to ₹ 29492.47 Lakh 2. Whether proposed to be listed? If yes, name of the stock exchange(s) The non-convertible debentures shall be listed on BSE Limited. BSE shall be the designated stock exchange. 3. Tenure of the instrument - date of allotment and date of maturity Please refer to Annexure B. 4. Coupon/interest offered, schedule of payment of coupon/interest and principal Please refer to Annexure B. 5. Charge/security, if any, created over the assets The principal amount of the NCDs to be issued in terms of the Draft Shelf Prospectus, the Shelf Prospectus, and the Tranche I Prospectus and the relevant Tranche Prospectus(es) together with all interest due on the NCDs, as well as all costs, charges, all fees, remuneration of Debenture Trustee and expenses payable in respect thereof shall be secured by way of an exclusive charge, by way of hypothecation created on loan receivables of our Company. The security shall be created upfront prior to making application for the listing of debentures and perfected within 30 days from the date of creation. Our Company shall maintain a security cover of at least 1.10 times the entire secured obligations throughout the tenure of the NCDs 6. Special right/interest/privileges attached to the instrument and changes thereof None 7. Delay in payment of interest / principal amount for a period of more than three months from the due date or default in payment of interest / principal Not applicable 8. Details of any letter or comments regarding payment/non-payment of interest, principal on due dates, or any other matter concerning the security and /or the assets along with its comments thereon, if any Not applicable 9. Details of redemption of debentures indicating the manner of redemption Please refer to Annexure B and Prospectus. Annexure B Specific terms of the issue Name of the Company PAISALO DIGITAL LIMITED Security Description SECURED, RATED, LISTED, REDEEMABLE, NON – CONVERTIBLE DEBENTURES Face/Paid-up value of NCDs (Rs. /NCD) 1,000.00 Issue Price of NCDs (Rs. /NCD) 1,000.00 Nature Secured Option I II III IV V VI Frequency Monthly Monthly Monthly Annual Monthly Annual No. of Securities 11,45,527 4,81,891 2,99,753 2,46,470 3,62,409 4,13,197 ISIN INE420C07197 INE420C07205 INE420C07213 INE420C07221 INE420C07239 INE420C07247 Coupon (%) per annum 9.00% 9.15% 9.50% 9.92% 10.00% 10.47% Effective Yield (per annum) for NCD holders 9.38% 9.53% 9.92% 9.91% 10.46% 10.46% Date of Allotment August 19, 2026 Redemption Amount (Rs./NCDs) for NCD Holders ₹ 1,000 ₹ 1,000 ₹ 1,000 ₹ 1,000 ₹ 1,000 ₹ 1,000 Redemption/Maturity date 19-Feb-28 19-Aug-28 19-Aug-29 19-Aug-29 19-Aug-31 19-Aug-31 First Interest payment date 10-Sep-26 10-Sep-26 10-Sep-26 19-Aug-27 10-Sep-26 19-08-2027 Put/Call Option Not App