t of the Show Cause Notice As the Performance Guarantee and Security Deposit is already encashed, there is no further financial implication as of now. 8 Action(s) taken by listed company with respect to the communication The Company has decided to avail appropriate and efficacious remedy by filing petition before competent forum as per direction by Hon’ble Court. 9 Any other relevant information NA",
