      "text": "BSE Limited Phiroze Jeejeebhoy Towers, Dalal Street, Mumbai - 400001 Scrip Code: 539686 National Stock Exchange of India Limited Exchange Plaza, Bandra Kurla Complex, Bandra (E), Mumbai - 400051 Symbol: KPEL Sub.: Intimation of Site Visit by Analyst(s)/ Institutional Investor(s) Dear Sir/Madam, Pursuant to the Regulation 30 of SEBI (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015, we would like to inform you that the officials of the Company will be interacting with a group of Analysts / Institutional Investors during a site visit scheduled on Tuesday, August 25, 2026, at the Company's wind project sites in Gujarat. During the meet, discussions will be confined to information already available in the public domain. No Unpublished Price Sensitive Information is proposed to be shared by the Company during the aforesaid Analyst / Institutional Investor(s) Meeting. The schedule of the aforesaid meeting is subject to change due to exigencies on the part of the Investor(s) and/or the Company. This information is also available on the Company’s website at www.kpenergy.in. This is for your information and records. Thanking You, For K.P. Energy Limited Affan Faruk Patel Whole Time Director DIN: 08576337 KPE/MAT/AUG/2026/667 August 20, 2026",
