aw Service, Ministry of Corporate Affairs, GNLU Indian Business & Commercial Laws Acade my (GIBCLA), the Insolvency and Bankruptcy Board of India Awareness Programme etc. She also served as course coordinator and resource person for different certificate courses on Corporate Governance, Company Law 2013, Insolvency and Bankruptcy Laws, Financ ial Market Laws etc. She has authored numerous research papers, articles and books and has been invited as a speaker , expert and panelist by numerous national and international institutions. Her distinguished academic and research contributions have significantly enriche d the field of legal education. 4. Disclosure of relationships between directors (in case of appointment of a director) None. ******",
