tract(s); Vikram Sarabhai Space Centre (“Department/Customer” ) 2. Significant terms and conditions of order(s)/contract(s) awarded in brief; 1. Product details : All the 3 segments of HS200 2. Contract Period : 4 years from the date of the contract 3. Raw material : Will be provided by the Department/Customer as Free Issue Materials (FIMs) 4. No additional cost of tooling will be paid by the Department/Customer. 3. Whether order(s) / contract(s) have been awarded by domestic/ international entity; Domestic entity 4. Nature of order(s) / contract(s); Supply of HS200 motorcase 5. Whether domestic or international; Domestic 6. Time period by which the order(s)/contract(s) is to be executed; 4 years from the date of the contract 7. Broad consideration or size of the order(s)/contract(s); Rs. 3,053 lakhs plus GST 8. Whether the promoter/ promoter group/ group companies have any interest in the entity that awarded the order(s)/contract(s)? If yes, nature of interest and details thereof; No Whether the order(s)/contract(s) would fall within related party transactions? If yes, whether the same is done at “arm’s length”. No For Walchandnagar Industries Ltd. G. S. Agrawal Whole Time Director & Company Secretary DIN: 00404340 Date: August 20, 2026",
