rkers Yes*** Available on Suprajit intranet 8 0 - 3 0 - Customers Yes**** https://suprajit.com/ investors/contactdetails/ 0 - - 0 - - Value Chain Partners Yes* https://suprajit.com/ investors/contact details/ 0 - - 0 - - Other (please specify) - - - - - - The Company has established various policies and mechanisms to address and resolve stakeholder grievances and concerns. These include the Code of Conduct, Whistleblower Policy, Non-Discrimination and Sexual Harassment Redressal Policy, Labour & HR Policy and Customer Complaints procedures. These policies are available on the Company’s official website at www.suprajit.com for easy access by employees and other stakeholders.",
