isition of 1,50,000 Equity shares (1% of the post issue capital) from existing shareholders and additional fresh issue of 1,48,50,000 Equity Shares (99% of the post issue capital). 10. Brief background about the entity acquired in terms of products/line of business acquired, date of incorporation, history of last 3 years’ turnover, country in which the acquired entity has presence and any other significant information (in brief) The Company is in the business of fashion silver jewellery. The Company was incorporated on December 19, 2025. Hence, the last 3-year turnover is not applicable. SJL has acquired Silvostyle Jewellery LLP by way of slump sale effective from May 01, 2026. Accordingly, w.e.f May 01, 2026, the business is being carried out in SJL. The turnover of Silvostyle Jewellery LLP is as below: (Rs. In Crore) Particulars March 31, 2026 March 31, 2025 March 31, 2024 Turnover 72. 93 40.46 27.09 PAT 6.36 3.66 1.60 Country of presence: India",
