      "text": "August 21, 2026 NSE Limited Exchange Plaza, C-1, Block G, Bandra Kurla Complex, Bandra (E) Mumbai - 400 051 BSE Limited, Floor 25, Phiroze Jeejeebhoy Towers, Dalal Street Mumbai - 400 001 Dear Sir/Madam, Company's Scrip Code in BSE : 543530 Company’s Symbol in NSE : PARADEEP ISIN : INE088F01024 Sub: Schedule of Investor/Analyst Meet Pursuant to Regulation 30 of the Securities and Exchange Board of India (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015, we wish to inform the exchanges that the Company through its Management Representatives shall be meeting Analyst /Institutional Investors as per below schedule. Date of the meeting Interaction type Place of Meeting 26.08.2026 & 27.08.2026 Physical One -to-One Interactions with analysts/investors Mumbai Note: The schedule of the aforesaid meetings is subject to change. The change may happen due to exigencies on the part of Analyst/Institutional Investor/Company. No Unpublished Price Sensitive Information is proposed to be shared by the Company during the aforesaid Investor Meetings. We request you to kindly note the same and take into your records. Thanking you, Yours faithfully, For Paradeep Phosphates Limited Sachin Patil Company Secretary",
