      "text": "August 21, 2026 National Stock Exchange of India Ltd., Exchange Plaza, C-1 Block G, Bandra Kurla Complex Bandra [E], Mumbai – 400051 BSE Ltd., Phiroze Jeejeebhoy Towers, Dalal Street, Fort, Mumbai - 400 001 NSE Scrip Symbol: BLS BSE Scrip Code: 540073 Subject: Update on De-registration of Step Down Subsidiary Dear Sir / Madam, Pursuant to Regulation 30 read with Schedule III of Securities and Exchange Board of India (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations 2015, and in continuation of our earlier corporate announcement dated October 17, 2025, where it was informed to the Exchanges that company has received information from the Office of Overseas subsidiaries, that they are under process to liquidate Visametric LLC, Tajikistan, step Down subsidiary of the Company. We would like to update the Exchanges that Visametric LLC, Tajikistan has been de-registered w.e.f August 21, 2026. Pursuant to said de-registration, Visametric LLC, Tajikistan cease to exist as Step down subsidiary of the Company. You are requested to take the same on your records. For BLS International Services Limited ……………………… Dharak A. Mehta Company Secretary and Compliance Officer ICSI Membership No.: FCS 12878",
