      "text": "LEEL ELECTRICALS LIMITED (Formerly Lloyd Electric & Engineering Limited) Reg. Office: A-603 & 604. Logix Technova, Sec-132, Noida, U.P. PIN 201304 Contact No: 0120-4098444, 9910616750 ENQINCERING AIR E-mail: info@leelelectric.com Date: 21.08.2026 To, BSE Limited National Stock Exchange of India Phiroze Jeejeebhoy Towers, Dalal Street, Exchange Plaza, Plot No. C/1, G Block, Mumbai-400001 BandraKurla Complex Bandra(E),Mumbai —400051 Ref: LEEL Electricals Limited Ref: LEEL Electricals Limited (Scrip Code —517518) (NSE Symbol - LEEL) Sub: Intimation under Regulation 30 of SEBI (Listing Obligation and Disclosure Requirement) Regulation, 2015 — Inclusion in Banaras Locomotive Works (BLW) approved vendor list. Dear Sir/Ma’am, Pursuant to the provisions of Regulation 30 of the SEBI (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirement) Regulations 2015, we wish to inform you that LEEL Electricals Limited (“Company”) has been included in the Approved Vendor List of Banaras Locomotive Works (BLW). The Banaras Locomotive Works (BLW) has done the capability and capacity assessment of company’s new production facility at Plot 5-6-7, IIE SIDCUL, Sector 4 Pant Nagar Rudrapur. The disclosure will also be made available to the company website. Kindly take the same on your records. Thanking You. For LEEL Electricals Limited SO Neeraj Gupta Managing Director DIN: 07176093 Plant Address: Plot No. 5, 6-7, Sector-4, IIE SIDCUL, Pant Nagar, Rudrapur, Uttarakhand-263153 ‘Website: www.leelelectric.com CIN: L29120UP1987PLC091016",
