      "url": "https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/KAYNESTECH_22082026190258_SEIntimationPRBOSGAME.pdf",
      "text": "KAYNES TECHNOLOGY INDIA LIMITED CIN: L29128KA2008PLC045825 website: www.kaynestechnology.co.in email ID: kaynestechcs@kaynestechnology.net H.O & Registered office: 23-25, Belagola, Food Industrial Estate Metagalli PO, Mysore 570016 India Telephone No: +91 8212582595 August 22, 2026 BSE Limited Corporate Relationship Dept., 14th floor, P. J. Tower, Dalal Street, Fort Mumbai - 400 001 Scrip Code: 543664 National Stock Exchange of India Limited Exchange Plaza, Plot no. C/1, G Block, Bandra-Kurla Complex, Bandra (E), Mumbai - 400 051 Scrip Symbol: KAYNES Dear Sir/Madam, Subject: Intimation of Press release - BOSGAME ENTERS INDIA WITH KAYNES TECHNOLOGY; COMPANIES SIGN STRATEGIC MoU TO BUILD A STRONG COMPUTING PRESENCE IN INDIA Pursuant to Regulation 30 of SEBI (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015, please find enclosed the press release titled “BOSGAME enters India with Kaynes Technology; Companies sign strategic MoU to build a strong computing presence in India.” The above -mentioned information will also be available on website of the Company www.kaynestechnology.co.in . We request to kindly take this intimation on record. Thanking You, Yours faithfully, For Kaynes Technology India Limited Sudhasri Addepalli Company Secretary and Compliance Officer ICSI membership no: A79832 Kaynes Technology India Limited | Press Release | 2 2 August 2026 KAYNES TECHNOLOGY INDIA LIMITED | PRESS RELEASE BOSGAME ENTERS INDIA WITH KAYNES TECHNOLOGY; COMPANIES SIGN STRATEGIC MoU TO BUILD A STRONG COMPUTING PRESENCE IN INDIA Collaboration brings together BOSGAME’s intelligent computing portfolio with Kaynes Technology’s engineering, manufacturing and market execution capabilities India | 22 August 2026: Kaynes Technology India Limited and BOSGAME today announced the signing of a strategic Memorandum of Understanding (MoU), marking an important step towards establishing and expanding BOSGAME’s presence in the Indian market. The collaboration brings together BOSGAME’s product innovation and intelligent computing portfolio with Kaynes Technology’s extensive capabilities in electronics design, engineering, integrated manufacturing, testing, supply-chain management and lifecycle support. BOSGAME’s product design has earned international recognition, including the American Good Design Award, the French Design Award and the MUSE Design Awards, underscoring the brand’s design-led engineering approach as it expands into India. BOSGAME Design Recognition – American Good Design, French Design Award, MUSE Design Awards Through this partnership, the companies intend to create a strong platform for introducing BOSGAME products to the Indian market, developing market channels and building a locally supported customer ecosystem. The collaboration will also explore opportunities for product localisation, value addition and deeper participation in India’s rapidly evolving electronics ecosystem, aligned with market requirements and long-term growth opportunities. The MoU was signed on behalf of Kaynes Technology India Limited by Mr. Jaydeep Jadav, Head – Brand Business, with Ms. Lucky Wang, Vice President, Six United, representing BOSGAME. Kaynes Technology India Limited | Press Release | 2 2 August 2026 MoU Signing Ceremony – Kaynes Technology, BOSGAME and Six United Mr. Jaydeep Jadav, Head – Brand Business, Kaynes Technology India Limited, said: “India is entering an exciting phase in electronics where global product innovation is increasingly being complemented by strong local engineering, manufacturing and customer support capabilities. Our collaboration with BOSGAME is aligned with this transition. We look forward to combining BOSGAME’s product strengths with Kaynes Technology’s capabilities to build a scalable and sustainable presence for the brand in India.” Ms. Lucky Wang, Vice President, Six United, BOSGAME, said: “India is an important technology market with significant long-term potential. We are pleased to collaborate with Kaynes Technology, whose engineering, manufacturing and execution capabilities provide a strong foundation for our India journey. Together, we look forward to bringing innovative computing solutions closer to Indian customers and building a meaningful presence in the market.” The partnership comes at a time when India is strengthening its position across the electronics value chain, with increasing emphasis on design-led manufacturing, local value creation, supply-chain resilience and technology-driven product development. By combining international product innovation with Indian engineering and manufacturing capabilities, Kaynes Technology and BOSGAME aim to create a strong foundation for the next phase of BOSGAME’s growth in India. About Kaynes Technology India Limited Kaynes Technology India Limited is an end-to-end integrated electronics manufacturer in India and a Production-Linked Incentive (PLI) scheme holder across IT Hardware, IoT and Telecom, with capabilities across the Electronics System Design and Manufacturing spectrum. With more than three decades of experience, the company provides services spanning conceptual design, process engineering, integrated manufacturing and lifecycle support across multiple industry verticals. About BOSGAME Founded in 2019, BOSGAME is a technology company focused on intelligent computing products, including mini PCs and laptop product lines. The company integrates R&D, production and sales, with Shenzhen serving as its operational hub, and is focused on delivering intelligent hardware products to customers globally. Kaynes Technology India Limited | Press Release | 2 2 August 2026 Product Images BOSGAME Mini PC BOSGAME Laptop Kaynes Technology India Limited | Press Release | 2 2 August 2026 BOSGAME Tablet BOSGAME Mini PC Kaynes Technology India Limited | Press Release | 2 2 August 2026 BOSGAME Product Lineup – Laptop, Tablet and Mini PC BOSGAME Monitor — END —",
