      "text": "MAGELLANIC CLOUD LIMITED Formerly known as South India Projects Limited CIN: L72100TG1981PLC169991 Registered Office: 6th Floor, Dallas Center, 83/1, Plot No A1 Knowledge City, Rai Durg Hyderabad Rangareddi TG 500032 Telephone No.: 040-46515454 www.magellanic-cloud.com info@magellanic-cloud.com August 24, 2026 BSE Limited, Dept. of Corporate Services, 14th Floor, P.J. Towers, Dalal Street, Fort, Mumbai - 400001 Scrip Code: 538891/Scrip ID : MCLOUD National Stock Exchange of India Ltd., Dept. of Corporate Services, Exchange Plaza, BandraKurla Complex, Bandra (East), Mumbai - 400051 Symbol: MCLOUD/Series: EQ Sub: Intimation pursuant to Regulation 30 of the SEBI (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 201 5 – Amendment to the list of Ultimate Beneficial Owners Dear Sir/Madam, Pursuant to Regulation 30 of the Securities and Exchange Board of India (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015, Noti ce of the Extra-Ordinary General Meeting (“Notice”) dated June 25, 2026, the Corrigendum to the Notice (“Corrigendum”) dated July 20, 2026, we wish to inform you that the Company has received certain observation from National Stock Exchange of India Limited regarding details of Ultimate Beneficial Owners of one of the Proposed allottee namely Balaji Malts Private Limited. In this regard, we would like to inform you that in our Notice dated June 25, 2026, and Corrigendum dated July 20, 2026, the name of the Ultimate Beneficial Owner of Balaji Malts Private Limited was as follows: Sr. No. Name of the Ultimate Beneficial Owner of Balaji Malts Private Limited 1. Prasun Jodhani 2. Nirmal Kumar Jodhani 3. Sangita Jodhani 4. Anita Jodhani 5. Saket Jodhani 6. Jodhani Papers Private Limited However, based on NSE’s observation, the name of th e Ultimate Beneficial Owner of Balaji Malts Private Limited shall now be read as follows: Sr. No. Name of the Ultimate Beneficial Owner of Balaji Malts Private Limited 1. Prasun Jodhani* 2. Nirmal Kumar Jodhani* 3. Sangita Jodhani* 4. Anita Jodhani* 5. Saket Jodhani 6. Jodhani Papers Private Limited Ultimate Beneficial Owner of Jodhani Papers Private Limited are as follows: Surendra Kumar Jodhani Saurabh Jodhani Narendra Kumar Jodhani Babita Jodhani Hemanth Kumar Jodhani MAGELLANIC CLOUD LIMITED Formerly known as South India Projects Limited CIN: L72100TG1981PLC169991 Registered Office: 6th Floor, Dallas Center, 83/1, Plot No A1 Knowledge City, Rai Durg Hyderabad Rangareddi TG 500032 Telephone No.: 040-46515454 www.magellanic-cloud.com info@magellanic-cloud.com Aditya Jodhani Sumitra Jodhani Mohit Jodhani *The aforementioned Ultimate Beneficial Owners (“UBOs”) of Balaji Malts Private Limited, listed under Nos. 1–4, are also the UB Os of Jodhani Papers Private Limited and, accordingly, have not been repeated herein The above clarification and update form part of th e EGM Notice dated June 25, 2026, and Corrigendum dated July 20, 2026, and are being disseminated for the information of the Members and other stakeholders. The Company remains committed to ensuring timely di sclosures, obtaining all requisite approvals, and complying with the letter and spirit of all applicable laws, regulations and regulatory requirements. We request you to kindly take the above information on record Thanking You, Yours Faithfully, For Magellanic Cloud Limited Jagan Mohan Reddy Thumma Managing Director DIN: 06554945",
