      "text": "HEG/SECTT/2026 August 24, 2026 To BSE Limited Phiroze Jeejeebhoy Towers, Dalal Street, Mumbai - 400 001 SCRIP CODE: 509631 To NaƟonal Stock Exchange of India Limited Exchange Plaza, C-1, BlockG, Bandra Kurla Complex, Bandra (East), Mumbai - 400 051 SYMBOL: HEG Outcome of Board MeeƟng held on August 24, 2026 Sub: Disclosures under Regula Ɵon 30, 42 and other applicable provisions of the Securi Ɵes and Exchange Board of India (LisƟng ObligaƟons and Disclosure Requirements) RegulaƟons, 2015 (“LisƟng RegulaƟons”) Ref: Composite Scheme of Arrangement amongst HEG Limited (“ Company”) and HEG Graphite Limited (“ResulƟng Company ”) and Bhilwara Energy Limited (“ Transferor Company ”) and their respec Ɵve shareholders and creditors under SecƟons 230 to 232 and other applicable provisions of the Companies Act, 2013 (“Scheme”) Dear Sir / Madam In furtherance to our le Ʃer dated August 18, 2026, thereby informing, that the Composite Scheme of Arrangement amongst HEG Limited (“ Company” or “ Demerged Company” or “ Transferee Company”) and HEG Graphite Limited (“ResulƟng Company”) and Bhilwara Energy Limited (“Transferor Company”) and their respecƟve shareholders and creditors under Sec Ɵons 230 to 232 and other applicable provisions of the Companies Act, 2013 (“Scheme”) has been sancƟoned by the NaƟonal Company Law Tribunal, Indore Bench (“Tribunal\") on August 13, 2026, this is to inform you that the Board of Directors of the Company (\"Board\"), at its meeƟng held today i.e. August 24, 2026, has inter alia: 1. Taken on record the cerƟﬁed copy of the Order dated August 13, 2026 passed by the Hon’ble NaƟonal Company Law Tribunal, Indore Bench ( “Tribunal\") sanc Ɵoning the Scheme. Cer Ɵﬁed copy of the Tribunal Order was received on August 21, 2026; 2. Approved to make the Scheme eﬀecƟve on Tuesday, September 01, 2026 (“EﬀecƟve Date”); 3. In consultaƟon with the Resul Ɵng Company, ﬁxed Monday, September 7, 2026, as the record date for determining the shareholders of the Company eligible to receive considera Ɵon pursuant to the Scheme (“Record Date”). Further, the consideraƟon under the Scheme is as follows: a) For demerger, transfer and vesƟng of the Demerged Undertaking (as deﬁned in the Scheme) from the Company into the ResulƟng Company The ResulƟng Company shall issue and allot to each shareholder of the Company as on Record Date, as under: 1 (One) fully paid-up equity share of INR 2 (Indian Rupees Two only) each of the Resul Ɵng Company, credited as fully paid up, for every 1 (One) equity share of INR 2 (Indian Rupees Two only) each of the Company. b) For amalgamaƟon of the Transferor Company with the Company The Company shall issue and allot to each shareholder of the Transferor Company (except the Company itself) as on EﬀecƟve Date, as under: 8 (Eight) fully paid-up equity shares of INR 2 (Indian Rupees Two only) each of the Company, credited as fully paid up, for every 7 (Seven) equity shares of INR 10 (Indian Rupees Ten only) each of the Transferor Company. 4. Subsequent to the eﬀecƟveness of the Scheme and to ensure conƟnuity of the Graphite Business (as deﬁned in the Scheme), the Board based on the recommenda Ɵon from the Nomina Ɵon and RemuneraƟon Commi Ʃee and Audit Commi Ʃee (as applicable) , has approved/taken note of the following appointment and resignaƟons; Sr. No. Name of the Directors/ KMP/SMP ParƟculars of change with eﬀect from the Eﬀec Ɵve Date i.e. September 01, 2026 Ref. Annexure* 1. Shri Vivek Chaudhary CessaƟon as Company Secretary & Compliance Oﬃcer and Key Managerial Personnel of the Company consequent upon transfer of his employment to HEG Graphite Limited pursuant to the eﬀec Ɵveness of the Composite Scheme of Arrangement Annexure A 2. Shri Ravi Kant Tripathi CessaƟon as Chief Financial Oﬃcer and Key Managerial Personnel of the Company consequent upon transfer of his employment to HEG Graphite Limited pursuant to the eﬀecƟveness of the Composite Scheme of Arrangement Annexure A 3. Ms. Neha Rajvan