      "text": "Registered Office: NITCO Limited, 3/A, Recondo Compound, Sudam Kalu Ahire Marg, Glaxo, Worli Colony, Mumbai, Maharashtra, India, 400 030. Tel.: 91-22-25772800|25772790. CIN: L26920MH1966PLC016547. Email: investorgrievances@nitco.in Website: www. nitco.in NITCO/SE/2026-27/34 August 24, 2026 To, Corporate Service Department BSE Limited Jeejeebhoy Towers Dalal Street, Mumbai – 400 001 Script code: 532722 The Listing Department National Stock Exchange of India Limited Exchange Plaza, Bandra Kurla Complex, Bandra (E), Mumbai – 400 051 Script code: NITCO Dear Sir/Madam, Sub: Intimation of receipt of capital advance from M/s Saumya Buildcon Private Limited We wish to inform that Nitco Limited (“the Company”) had provided a capital advance to Saumya Buildcon Private Limited (“SBPL”) more than a decade ago, in connection with the procurement of land. However, the proposed land transaction did not materialise and, consequently, the capital advance remained outstanding from SBPL. As part of the Company’s ongoing efforts towards recovery and regularization of longoutstanding advances, the Company has received the entire balance outstanding amount of Rs. 995.98 Lakhs from SBPL. Accordingly, the aforesaid capital advance has been fully recovered and settled as on date, and no amount remains outstanding from SBPL in respect of the said capital advance. Kindly take the above information on your records. Thanking You, Yours faithfully, For Nitco Limited Vivek Talwar Chairman & Managing Director DIN: 00043180",
