      "url": "https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/INFY_24082026215249_SE_24082026.pdf",
      "text": "TO ALL STOCK EXCHANGES BSE LIMITED NATIONAL STOCK EXCHANGE OF INDIA LIMITED NEW YORK STOCK EXCHANGE August 24, 2026 Dear Sir/ Madam, Sub: Appointment of Senior Management Personnel This is to inform you that, based on the recommendations of the Nomination and Remuneration Committee, the Board approved and appointed Mitrankur Majumdar as Segment Head for Services Utilities Resources and Energy (‘SURE’) and as Senior Management Personnel of the Company with immediate effect. The details as required under Regulation 30 of Securities and Exchange Board of India (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015 is enclosed as annexure. This disclosure will also be made available on the Company’s website www.infosys.com. This is for your information and records. Yours sincerely, For Infosys Limited Manikantha A.G.S. Company Secretary Membership No: A21918 Annexure Details as required under Regulations 30 of Securities and Exchange Board of India (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015 Particulars Details Name Mitrankur Majumdar Reason for change viz. appointment, re - appointment, resignation, removal, death or otherwise; Appointment as Segment Head for SURE and as Senior Management Personnel The current Segment Head for SURE, Ashiss Kumar Dash will spend more time with external training and transition activities as the CEO designate. Date of appointment/re-appointment/ cessation (as applicable) & term of appointment/re-appointment; Date of appointment as a Senior Management personnel - August 24, 2026 Brief profile (in case of appointment); Enclosed Disclosure of relationships between directors (in case of appointment of a director) Not Applicable Mitrankur (Mit) Majumdar Executive Vice President and Global Head, SURE ( Services Utilities Resources and Energy), Infosys Mitrankur (Mit) Majumdar is the Executive Vice President and Global Head of the SURE segment at Infosys, leading the company's business across Services, Utilities, Resources and Energy. He collaborates with C-suite leaders across Global 2000 organizations and high-growth enterprises to shape business strategies, deliver transformative outcomes, and create lasting value through AI, data, cloud, and emerging technologies. With over 30 years of experience , Mit has evolved from a technology practitioner to a global business leader, bringing a distinctive blend of technical depth, strategic thinking, and market leadership. This broad experience enables him to help enterprises accelerate transformation, drive innovation, and achieve sustainable growth in an increasingly digital and AI-driven world. In addition to his role as the leader of the SURE segment Mit is also spearheads efforts to build and leverage strategic AI partnerships and ecosystems that strengthen Infosys' ability to deliver and scale Enterprise AI for clients globally. He also plays a pivotal role in advancing Infosys' Global Capability Center (GCC) practice, helping enterprises establish and transform GCCs into engines of innovation, talent, and business value. Prior to leading the SURE segment, Mit served as Global Head of Services at Infosys, where he led growth across travel and hospitality, information services, publishing, professional services, education, engineering, construction, and real estate industrie s. His deep understanding of industry transformation, coupled with a strong focus on AI and innovation, has enabled clients to build more resilient, adaptive, and future-ready enterprises. Mit also serves on the advisory boards of East Texas A&M University's College of Business and University of Maryland’s Robert H. Smith School of Business. Mit holds a Bachelor of Engineering degree in Electronics and Telecommunication and an MBA from McCombs School of Business at UT Austin . He has also completed a Global Leadership Program from Stanford University Graduate School of Business and a Leadership Program from Harvard Business School.",
      "error": "",
      "updatedAt": "25-Aug-2026 00:40 IST"
    },
