      "url": "https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ANLON2013_25082026232619_AHLCorrigendumSigned.pdf",
      "text": "ANLON HEALTHCARE LIMITED CIN No.: L24230GJ2013PLC077543 REGISTERED OFFICE: 101/102, Silver Coin Complex, Opp. Crystal M all, Kalawad Road, Rajkot360005, Gujarat (INDIA) PHONE NO.: +91-7069690081/82 | Email: info@anlonhealthcare.com | www.anlon.in August 25, 2026 To, Listing Department, BSE Limited Phiroze Jeejeebhoy Towers, Dalal Street, Mumbai – 400 001 Ref: BSE Scrip Code: 544497 To, The National Stock Exchange of India Ltd. The Listing Department Exchange Plaza, Bandra – Kurla Complex, Mumbai – 400051, NSE Scrip Code: AHCL Sub: Corrigendum to the Notice of 13 th (Thirteenth) Annual General Meeting (“AGM”) to be held on Saturday, September 05, 2026 at 11:00 a.m. IST. Respected Sir/Madam, Dear Sir/Madam, In continuation to the Company's intimation dated August 13, 2026, whereby the Notice convening the 13th (Thirteenth) Annual General Meeting (“AGM”) of the Company scheduled to be held on Saturday, September 05, 2026 at 11:00 a.m. IST. through video conferencing (“VC”) /other Audio - Visual Means (“OAVM”) along with the Annual report for the financial year 2025-2026 was submitted to the stock exchange, a Corrigendum to AGM Notice is being issued and enclosed herewith pursuant to the observations raised by Bombay Stock Exchange Limited (“BSE”) and National Stoc k Exchange of India Limited (“NSE”) dated August 18, 2026 and August 19, 2026 respecti vely, in relation to the inprinciple application made by the Company towards issu e and allotment of shares on preferential basis, on certain points under Notice and Explanatory Statement forming part of the Annual General Meeting (AGM) Notice dated Augu st 13, 2026. Except as detailed in the corrigendum, all other contents of the Notice of the 13 th (Thirteenth) AGM shall remain unchanged. The AGM Notice should be read in continuation of and in conjunction with the corrigendum. This corrigendum has been sent to the registered email-ids of the Shareholders. The same is also available on the website of the Company at www.anlon.in. Thanking You. For ANLON HEALTHCARE LIMITED PUNITKUMAR RASADIA MANAGING DIRECTOR DIN: 06696258 ANLON HEALTHCARE LIMITED CIN No.: L24230GJ2013PLC077543 REGISTERED OFFICE: 101/102, Silver Coin Complex, Opp. Crystal M all, Kalawad Road, Rajkot360005, Gujarat (INDIA) PHONE NO.: +91-7069690081/82 | Email: info@anlonhealthcare.com | www.anlon.in Corrigendum to the Notice of 13th (Thirteenth) Annual General Meeting (“AGM”) to be held on Saturday, September 05, 2026 at 11:00 a.m. IST. This Corrigendum to the 13th (Thirteenth) Annual General Meeting (“AGM”) of Anlon Healthcare Limited is hereby issued pursuant to the observations raised by Bombay Stock Exchange Limited (“BSE”) and National Stoc k Exchange of India Limited (“NSE”) dated August 18, 2026 and August 19, 2026 respecti vely, in relation to the inprinciple application made by the Company towards issu e and allotment of shares on preferential basis, on certain clauses under Notice and explanatory statement forming part of the Annual General Meeting (AGM) Notice dated August 13, 2026. This corrigendum shall form an integral part of the Notice of AGM which has already been circulated to shareholders of the Company via email dated August 14, 2026, and always be read in conjunction with this corrigendum. It is made available on the website of the stock exchange i.e. BSE at www.bseindia.com, NSE at www.nseindia.com, and on the website of the Company at www.anlon.in. All other contents of the Notice of AGM, save and except as modified or supplemented by the Corrigendum, shall remain unchanged. The shareholders are therefore requested to note the below revised clauses in Notice and explanatory statement forming part of the AGM Notice. 1. In Notice of the AGM, at Item No. 8 and at point no. 2 of the resolution, the tables stand revised and replaced as below: “The details of the AOPL Proposed Allottees and the maximum number of equity shares of the Company proposed to be allotted to them are provided in 