      "text": "Poly Medicure Limited Regd. Office: 232 B, 3rd Floor, Okhla Industrial Estate, Phase-Ill, New Delhi -110 020 (INDIA) T: +91-11-33550700, 47317000 E: info@polymedicure.com W: polymedicure.com CIN: L 40300DL l 995PLC066923 Date: 25th August , 2026 Scrip Code: - 531768 The Manager, BSE Limited, Department of Corporate Services, Phirozee Jeejeebhoy Towers, Dalal Street, Mumbai400001 . Scrip Code:- POL YMED The Manager ,'IPOLYMED National Stock Exchange of India Limited Exchange Plaza, Plot No. C/1-Block-G Bandra Kurla Complex, Bandra(E), Mumbai-400051 . SUB: Intimation of Schedule of Investor's Meet under Regulation 30 of SEBI (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015 Dear Sir/Ma'am, Pursuant to Regulation 30 of the SEBI (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirem ents) Regulati ons, 2015, read with Part A of Schedule III thereto, we hereby inform that with reference to our intimations dated 17th August, 2026 and 20th August, 2026 regarding Analyst/ Investor Call, the one-on-one/ virtual meeting with analysts/ investors has been re-scheduled . The details of the re-scheduled meeting are as under : I Investor's II Meeting Date 11~ 1 Format II Re-scheduled Date I Wasatch Global . 1rtua ne-on-one Thursday, 20th August □· I E Thursday , 27th August, 2026, 2026, 06:30 PM India Time 06:30 PM Indian Time Further , the venue and format of the rescheduled meeting shall remain the same as that of the origi nall y scheduled meeting. The above schedule is subject to changes which may happen due to exigencies on th e part of the Analysts / Investors/ the Company. No Unpublished Price Sensitive Information will be shared during the meeting . The confirmation of the aforesaid schedule was received on shorter notice . Hence, the intimation is being made at a shorter notice . Kindly take the same on your record . Thanking You, Yours Sincerely For Poly Medicure Limited Avinash Chandra Company Secretary M. No. A32270 Plants: Plot No. l 04-105 & 115-116-117, Sector -59, HSIIDC Industrial Area, Ballabgarh , Faridabad - 121004, Haryana (INDIA) Plot No. 33-34, Sector-68, IMT, Faridabad -121004, (Haryana) INDIA T: +91 -129-4287000 , 3355070",
