      "text": "August 25, 2026 To NaƟonal Stock Exchange of India Limited Exchange Plaza, C-1, Block G Bandra Kurla Complex Bandra (E), Mumbai – 400 051 To BSE Limited Phiroze Jeejeebhoy Towers Dalal Street, Mumbai – 400 001 NSE SYMBOL: MVELECTRO SCRIP CODE: 544851 Subject: Outcome of meeƟng of the Board of Directors held on Tuesday, August 25, 2026 Respected Sir/ Madam, Pursuant to the provisions of RegulaƟon 30 and 33 and any other applicable provisions, if any, of the SEBI (LisƟng ObligaƟons and Disclosure Requirements) RegulaƟons, 2015 (“SEBI LisƟng RegulaƟons”), we hereby inform you that the Board of Directors of the Company at its mee Ɵng held today i.e., Tuesday, August 25, 2026 has inter-alia, considered and approved the following businesses: 1. Un-audited Financial Results for the Quarter ended June 30, 2026: - Pursuant to RegulaƟon 33 of the SEBI (Lis Ɵng ObligaƟons and Disclosure Requirements) RegulaƟons, 2015, we submit herewith (i) the Limited Review Report by the Statutory Auditors, M/s. Sanmarks & Associates, Chartered Accountants (ii) Un-audited Financial Results for the Quarter ended June 30, 2026. (‘Annexure-I’) The above results have been duly reviewed and recommended by the Audit CommiƩee to the Board and subsequently approved by the Board. 2. Appointment of M/s Taruna Kalra & Associates, Prac Ɵsing Company Secretaries as Secretarial Auditors of the Company from the ﬁnancial year 2026-27 up to and including the ﬁnancial year 203031: - On the Recommenda Ɵon of Audit commi Ʃee, Appointment of M/s Taruna Kalra & Associates, PracƟsing Company Secretaries as the Secretarial Auditors of the Company from the ﬁnancial year 2026-27 up to and including the ﬁnancial year 2030-31 subject to the approval of Members of the Company. The said appointment is based on the recommendaƟon of the Audit CommiƩee of the Company. The Disclosure of informaƟon with respect to above stated item 2 pursuant to RegulaƟon 30 read with Para A of Part A of Schedule Ill of the SEBI Lis Ɵng Regula Ɵons and SEBI Master Circular No. HO/49/14/14(7)2025-CFD-POD2/1/3762/2026 dated 30\" January 2026, is enclosed (‘Annexure-II’). 3. Appointment of M/s G B S G & Associates, Chartered Accountants as Internal Auditors of the Company for the ﬁnancial year 2026-27: - On the RecommendaƟon of Audit commiƩee, Appointment of M/s G B S G & Associates, Chartered Accountants as the Internal Auditors of the Company for the ﬁnancial year 2026-27. The said appointment is based on the recommendaƟon of the Audit CommiƩee of the Company. The Disclosure of informaƟon with respect to above stated item 2 pursuant to RegulaƟon 30 read with Para A of Part A of Schedule Ill of the SEBI Lis Ɵng Regula Ɵons and SEBI Master Circular No. HO/49/14/14(7)2025-CFD-POD2/1/3762/2026 dated 30\" January 2026, is enclosed (‘Annexure-III’). 4. Convening of 17th Annual General MeeƟng: - Convening of the 17 th Annual General Mee Ɵng (AGM) of the Company on Tuesday, September 29, 2026, through Video Conferencing (VC) or Other Audio-Visual Means (OAVM). The Cut-oﬀ date will be Tuesday, 22 nd September, 2026 for the purpose of ascertaining members enƟtled for remote e-voƟng and eligible to parƟcipate in ensuing 17th AGM. The Remote e voƟng will begin on 26th September, 2026 and end on 28th September, 2026. M/s Taruna Kalra & Associates , Prac Ɵcing Company Secretaries, is appointed as Scru Ɵnizer for scruƟnizing the remote e-voƟng and e-voƟng at the 17th Annual General MeeƟng. The noƟce of 17th AGM and Annual Report for FY 2025-26 shall be provided in due course. The Board MeeƟng commenced at 02:00 P .M (IST) and concluded at 4:00 P .M (IST). The same in ƟmaƟon is also being made available on the website of the Company at www.mvelectrosystems.com You are requested to take the same on record. Thanking You, FOR MV ELECTROSYSTEMS LIMITED Sourabh Bansal Company Secretary and Compliance Oﬃcer Membership No.: A49529 Place: Faridabad MV ELECTROSYSTEMS LIMITED CIN: U3 1401HR2009P1C140536 Regd. & Cor