entials. (f) tis further stated that— (A) remote e-voting shall not be allowed beyond 05:00 P.M. (IST) on Monday, 14” September, 2026; (B} Members present at the EQGM who have not already cast their vate by Temote e-voting shall be able to exercise their right to vote at the meeting through the poll paper/ballot facility to ba made available at the venue of the meeting; and (C) a Member may participate in the EOGM even after exercising his/her right to vote through remote e-voting, but shall not be entitled to vote again at the meeting. 4. The voting rights of Members shall be reckoned in proportion to their share in the paid-up equity share capital of the Company as on the cut-off date, i.e. Tuesday, 8th September, 2026. 5. Members holding shares in dematerialised form who have not registered their eMail addresses are requested to register the same with their Depository Participant (DP). Members holding shares in physical form may register their e-mail addresses with the Registrar & Share Transfer Agent, MUFG Intime India Private Limited, by writing to investor.helpdesk@in.mpms.mufg.com and lifeinmotion@daulatram.com, furnishing their Name, Folio Number, Certificate Number, PAN, mobile number and email address. 6. Proxies, in the prescribed form, duly signed by the Member entitled to attend and vote, must be deposited at the Registered Office of the Company not later than 48 hours before the commencement of the meeting. For Daulat Ram Engineering Services Limited SdiChander Prakash Sharma Managing Director DIN: 01633689 Place: Simrai, Raisen Date: 26/08/2026 DAf uyjivan svat FINANCE BANK Whereas, the undersigned, being the Authorised Officer of Uj notice within 60 days of the date of the notice. Section 13 oftheAct, in respect of time available, to redeem the secured assets. SECOND FLOOR, GMTT BUILDING D-7, SECTOR 3, NOIDA (U.P) - 201301 SYMBOLIC POSSESSION NOTICE (for immovable property) [Rule 8(1)] an Small Finance Bank Ltd., under the Securitisation and Reconstr