      "text": "26th August, 2026 The Secretary, Bombay Stock Exchange Ltd (BSE) Phiroze Jheejheebhoy Towers, Dalal Street, Mumbai - 400 001. Scrip Code - 543308 ISIN: INE967H01025 The Secretary, National Stock Exchange, Exchange Plaza, 5th Floor Plot No.C/1, 'G' Block Bandra - Kurla Complex Mumbai - 400 051. Symbol - KIMS ISIN: INE967H01025 Dear Sir/Madam, Sub: Clarification regarding article appearing in Dealstreetasia.com dated 25 th August 2026 titled “ChrysCapitalbacked KIMS in talks to acquire stake in Renova Hospitals for $52 Million” This is with reference to the news item/article titled “ChrysCapitalbacked KIMS in talks to acquire stake in Renova Hospitals for $52 Million” published in dealstreetasia.com. We would like to clarify that the contents of the said news report/article are completely false, baseless, and factually incorrect. As on date, the Company has neither entered into any such agreement or memorandum of understanding (“MOU”), nor has it engaged in any discussions as alleged in the said report. The Company therefore requests that the aforesaid clarification be taken on record and the baseless speculation and rumours contained in the report be disregarded. The Company further confirms that it continues to comply with all applicable disclosure requirements under Regulation 30 of the SEBI (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015. The Company will continue to make appropriate disclosures to the Stock Exchanges regarding any material development, event or information, as and when required under the applicable laws and regulations. Kindly take the above on your record. Thanking You, Yours truly For Krishna Institute of Medical Sciences Limited Dr. Nagajayanthi J. R. Company Secretary and Compliance Officer",
