1 : 2015 Quality Management Systems Scope of Certification: REAL ESTATE DEVELOPMENT, PROPERTY MANAGEMENT, AND LEASING OF RESIDENTIAL AND COMMERCIAL PROPERTIES. Certification Issue Date: 26/08/2026 1st Surveillance Audit Due Date: 25/08/2027 2nd Surveillance Audit Due Date: 25/08/2028 Certification Expiry Date: 25/08/2029 Certificate Number: E20260851859 Accredited OHSMS Certification CAB# 1190 Director (Certification) Audittech Certification Pvt. Ltd. (Formerly Royal Assessments Pvt. Ltd.) Tower - B, iThum, Plot No. A - 40, Sector - 62, Noida 201301, India. www.royalapl.com, info@royalapl.com Phone : +91 1146107691 This Certificate can be verified at www.iafcertsearch.org ACPL surveillance audits. ACPL is accredited by EGAC, Egypt. EGAC is member of International Accreditation Forum (IAF) and signatory of MLA.",
