dependent Directors on the Board of the Company. 3. Disclosure as per SEBI Master Circular No. HO/49/14/14(7)2025-CFD-POD2/I/3762/2026 dated January 30, 2026 is enclosed as Annexure - A. 4. Please take note of above information on record धÛयवाद, रेलटेल कॉपȾरेशन ऑफ इंͫडया ͧलͧमटेड के ͧलए जे. एस. मारवाह कंपनी सͬचव एव अनुपालन अͬधकारȣ सदèयता संÉया – एफ सी एस 8075 संलÊन: ऊपरोÈत अनुसार ͪवतरण:- 1) सहायक कंपनी सͬचव को फाइल मɅ रखने हेतु। 2) सहायक महाĤबंधक/पी.आर.ओ.को वेबसाइट पर अपलोड करने हेतु। Annexure - A Sr. No. Particulars Details 1 Name of the Authority BSE Limited (BSE) National Stock Exchange of India Limited (NSE) 2 Nature and details of the action(s) taken or order(s) passed Fine of Rs 9,00,340/- (inclusive of GST) Fine of Rs 9,00,340/- (inclusive of GST) 3 Date of receipt of direction or order, including any adinterim or interim orders, or any other communication from the authority BSE Email dated 25th August 2026 w.r.t Fines as per SEBI Master Circular No. HO/49/14/14(7)2025-CFDPOD2/I/3762/2026 issued on July 11, 2023 and last updated on January 30,2026 (Chapter VII (A)-Penal Action for Non - Compliance) (Received on 27/08/2026). NSE letter no. NSE/LIST - SOP/COMB/FINES/0954 dated 25th August, 2026. 4 Details of the violation(s)/contr avention(s) committed or alleged to be committed Non-compliance with Regulation 17(1) , 18(1) and 19(1)/(2) of the SEBI LODR for the quarter ended 30th June 2026. Non-compliance with Regulation 17(1) , 18(1) and 19(1)/(2) of the SEBI LODR for the quarter ended 30th June 2026. 5 Impact on financial, operation or other activities of the listed entity, quantifiable in monetary terms to the extent possible Has no impact Has no impact ----",
