e listed entity 4 Withdrawal/cancellation or suspension of licence/approval by the regulatory or licensing authority, with reasons for such action, estimated impact (monetary or otherwise) on the listed entity and penalty, if any Not Applicable 5 Period of Validity One time approval 6 Subsequently the Listed Company shall inform the stock exchange(s), the actual impact (monetary or otherwise) along with corrective actions taken by the Listed entity pursuant to the withdrawal, cancellation or suspension of the key license/ approval Not Applicable Thanking you Yours faithfully, For, Nesco Limited Shalini Kamath Company Secretary & Compliance Officer M. No. A14933",
